with all your colleagues.  By easily placing RSS feeds in any forum,
everyone in your group can automatically track the latest news and
headlines from relevant weblogs and other websites, without downloading
any extra software or even needing to know about RSS.  This complements
existing RSS support in CourseForum and ProjectForum, which allows users
to track changes in any forum via a per-forum RSS feed.

Other changes in these versions include several new standard and
add-on themes, enhancements to existing themes, the new ability to
directly include the content of other forum pages into any page,
and several additional bug fixes and enhancements.

